Alright, here we go.

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:30.529
Since you're my guest,
you're up first.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:32.265
When you're ready,
hit that button.

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.666
-Okay.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.635
