Like -- You look like you're --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.938
That's the worst photo
I could find.

00:09:32.938 --> 00:09:34.973
Every one was gorgeous.

00:09:34.973 --> 00:09:36.809
-See, it's
the same outfit, though.

00:09:36.809 --> 00:09:39.178
-That was like,
"Hurry, I hate fittings.

00:09:39.178 --> 00:09:40.579
I think we got it."

00:09:40.579 --> 00:09:41.980
-Alright. Well,
I'm going to post this.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.583
-Okay. Post it to my stories.

00:09:44.583 --> 00:09:45.650
-I think you got him, though.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:47.886
-Okay. I got him beat.

00:09:47.886 --> 00:09:49.621
Okay? He got a good photo.

00:09:49.621 --> 00:09:50.990
-Let me see it.

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:52.792
[ Laughter ]
[ Bang, bang ]

00:09:52.792 --> 00:09:55.093
-And I already --
-Is that -- That's not --

00:09:55.093 --> 00:09:56.962
I didn't know what I was doing.

00:09:56.962 --> 00:09:58.396
-Guys.
-I was trying to get --

00:09:58.396 --> 00:10:00.032
There's not anything in there.
-Is that booger in there?

00:10:00.032 --> 00:10:03.068
-You're a liar.
That is not at all.

00:10:03.068 --> 00:10:05.905
That is actually real bad.
[ Laughter ]

00:10:05.905 --> 00:10:08.040
It's actually awful. Alright. So
you're going to post that one.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.176
-Should I say, like,
"I hacked Jimmy's phone.

00:10:11.176 --> 00:10:12.744
It's me"?
-Yeah. Yes.

00:10:12.744 --> 00:10:14.346
-Yeah, please do that.
-Okay.

00:10:14.346 --> 00:10:16.382
Wait, you don't follow me? Oh.

00:10:16.382 --> 00:10:17.882
-Oh, my, God. That's not --

00:10:17.882 --> 00:10:19.384
[ Audience groaning ]

00:10:19.384 --> 00:10:21.653
No, that is so last year!

00:10:21.653 --> 00:10:23.355
No one follows anyone anymore.

00:10:23.355 --> 00:10:25.057
[ Foghorn blows ]

00:10:25.057 --> 00:10:26.692
It's, like, up there
with voicemail.

00:10:26.692 --> 00:10:28.960
Are you kidding me?
No, of course I follow you.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:31.763
-I need an extra follower,
so I'm taking that.

00:10:31.763 --> 00:10:33.732
-My thanks to
Kim Kardashian-West.

00:10:33.732 --> 00:10:34.767
Winnie Harlow!

